licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.

Third-party components retain their own licences:

- Patches under patches/ are derivative of the repositories they apply to and carry
  those projects' licences (Apache 2.0 for AOSP and LineageOS components, GPL-2.0 for
  the Linux kernel patch 0001).

- device/radxa/dragon_q6a/firmware/aic8800/ contains binary firmware for the AICSemi
  AIC8800D80 Wi-Fi/Bluetooth controller, redistributed from Radxa's package repository.
  It is firmware executed by the device, not by the host, and is distributed unmodified.

- device/radxa/dragon_q6a/kernel/modules/ contains kernel modules built from the
  AICSemi aic8800 driver sources (GPL-2.0) against the kernel used by this port.
  See scripts/build_aic8800.sh for how they are produced.
